# Three Settings panes overlapping, after MarkEdit's Settings shot: General in
# front at the top left, Themes behind it at the top right, Edit at the back
# below both. The point is a neat stack, not every control; overlap lets the
# group scale up.
# expect: General, Themes
# Settings labels are 13 pt and cannot zoom.
# legible: 24
# combine: 8c-settings-edit 8b-settings-themes 8a-settings-general
# layout: 0.45,0.63 0.65,0.36 0.33,0.33
